1
00:01:27,105 --> 00:01:31,025
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:35,385 --> 00:01:38,145
Jinxia Pass is a vital strategic point.

3
00:01:38,225 --> 00:01:39,425
If we lose it,

4
00:01:39,505 --> 00:01:41,425
Beijian's iron cavalry
can sweep straight in.

5
00:01:42,545 --> 00:01:43,745
As long as we stand, the pass stands.

6
00:01:43,825 --> 00:01:45,105
We cannot lose it.

7
00:01:45,185 --> 00:01:46,265
Report!

8
00:01:50,105 --> 00:01:50,945
Urgent report!

9
00:01:51,025 --> 00:01:52,585
Beijian's army has attacked Jinxia Pass.

10
00:01:52,665 --> 00:01:54,705
Beijian truly has wolfish ambitions.

11
00:01:55,305 --> 00:01:56,985
They changed their main
attack at the last second.

12
00:01:57,705 --> 00:01:58,585
General Di,

13
00:01:58,665 --> 00:02:00,945
we have only a handful of
troops left at Jinxia Pass.

14
00:02:01,025 --> 00:02:02,745
His Majesty is camped a hundred li away.

15
00:02:03,345 --> 00:02:04,505
Light the beacon.

16
00:02:04,585 --> 00:02:06,025
Within two hours at the latest,

17
00:02:06,105 --> 00:02:07,145
reinforcements will arrive.

18
00:02:07,225 --> 00:02:09,105
We are badly outnumbered by Beijian.

19
00:02:09,665 --> 00:02:10,905
I fear we cannot hold for two hours.

20
00:02:10,985 --> 00:02:11,985
They outnumber us.

21
00:02:13,025 --> 00:02:14,465
Our only defense is to attack.

22
00:02:15,025 --> 00:02:15,865
Pass my order.

23
00:02:16,585 --> 00:02:17,545
Light the beacon fires.

24
00:02:17,625 --> 00:02:18,785
Follow me into battle.

25
00:02:19,665 --> 00:02:20,505
Yes.

26
00:02:28,105 --> 00:02:30,225
The beacon is lit. Something's
wrong at Jinxia Pass.

27
00:02:30,305 --> 00:02:31,745
-Saddle the horses.
-Yes.

28
00:02:57,265 --> 00:02:58,585
Today,

29
00:02:58,665 --> 00:03:00,985
we will break through Jinxia Pass.

30
00:03:01,065 --> 00:03:01,905
Not a chance.

31
00:03:01,985 --> 00:03:06,425
-Kill!
-Kill!

32
00:04:07,945 --> 00:04:08,785
Huo An!

33
00:04:26,705 --> 00:04:27,545
Zhili.

34
00:04:28,025 --> 00:04:29,065
Happy birthday.

35
00:04:30,185 --> 00:04:31,185
You're another year older.

36
00:04:32,665 --> 00:04:33,985
And now I'm taller than you.

37
00:04:34,745 --> 00:04:36,505
From now on, I can always protect you.

38
00:04:37,065 --> 00:04:38,265
And one more thing.

39
00:04:38,345 --> 00:04:39,425
Stop calling me little brother.

40
00:04:40,025 --> 00:04:40,945
All right?

41
00:04:44,105 --> 00:04:44,945
Zhili.

42
00:04:45,585 --> 00:04:46,425
Happy birthday.

43
00:04:47,185 --> 00:04:48,305
You asked me what I wished for.

44
00:04:49,505 --> 00:04:50,345
I wanted to say...

45
00:04:50,985 --> 00:04:52,505
Ever since I entered the Shen household,

46
00:04:53,585 --> 00:04:55,185
my wish has never changed.

47
00:04:56,425 --> 00:04:57,465
I want to tell you

48
00:04:59,465 --> 00:05:00,385
that I like you.

49
00:05:01,745 --> 00:05:02,785
I truly do.

50
00:05:07,505 --> 00:05:08,345
Anian.

51
00:05:09,585 --> 00:05:10,425
Wait for me.

52
00:05:12,225 --> 00:05:15,145
I have so much I want to tell you.

53
00:05:48,225 --> 00:05:51,065
I found this while searching
a valley outside the capital.

54
00:05:51,145 --> 00:05:52,705
They say carrying it

55
00:05:52,785 --> 00:05:54,305
brings good luck.

56
00:05:54,385 --> 00:05:55,785
You need the luck more than I do.

57
00:05:56,345 --> 00:05:57,185
Zhili.

58
00:05:58,465 --> 00:05:59,305
Will you marry me?

59
00:05:59,385 --> 00:06:00,665
About my past...

60
00:06:02,345 --> 00:06:03,585
you truly don't care?

61
00:06:04,225 --> 00:06:05,065
I don't.

62
00:06:05,145 --> 00:06:08,505
But do you know the knot in my heart

63
00:06:08,585 --> 00:06:10,905
cannot be undone by saying you don't care?

64
00:06:14,945 --> 00:06:17,065
Zhili,

65
00:06:17,145 --> 00:06:19,185
do you like me even a little now?

66
00:06:30,625 --> 00:06:31,985
You said

67
00:06:32,825 --> 00:06:35,145
this peachwood brings good luck.

68
00:06:35,225 --> 00:06:36,505
It can keep people safe.

69
00:06:37,585 --> 00:06:39,465
I want you to come back safely.

70
00:06:48,625 --> 00:06:49,545
Anian.

71
00:07:09,785 --> 00:07:11,425
Soldiers of Daning!

72
00:07:11,985 --> 00:07:12,985
Not one step back!

73
00:07:31,225 --> 00:07:32,425
Anian!

74
00:07:36,505 --> 00:07:37,345
-Anian!
-Anian!

75
00:07:39,705 --> 00:07:40,785
Anian!

76
00:07:47,825 --> 00:07:48,705
Your Majesty.

77
00:07:49,985 --> 00:07:50,865
I...

78
00:07:52,225 --> 00:07:53,705
have fulfilled my mission.

79
00:08:10,865 --> 00:08:12,465
All soldiers, hear my command!

80
00:08:13,105 --> 00:08:16,065
Slaughter every Beijian dog!

81
00:08:17,545 --> 00:08:20,465
Send them to the grave
with our fallen men!

82
00:08:33,505 --> 00:08:35,025
Report! A great victory!

83
00:08:35,105 --> 00:08:36,345
Di Nian and Beijian's First Prince

84
00:08:36,425 --> 00:08:37,625
both died at Jinxia Pass.

85
00:08:43,865 --> 00:08:45,425
At last, the day has come.

86
00:08:46,665 --> 00:08:47,745
He's dead.

87
00:08:48,905 --> 00:08:50,145
Good.

88
00:08:52,185 --> 00:08:53,225
Anian.

89
00:08:56,225 --> 00:08:57,065
Anian.

90
00:08:58,905 --> 00:08:59,985
Princess.

91
00:09:00,905 --> 00:09:02,265
I kept my promise to you.

92
00:09:02,905 --> 00:09:04,625
Zhongwan lost not a single soldier,

93
00:09:05,505 --> 00:09:07,145
yet took the realm with ease.

94
00:09:10,505 --> 00:09:11,345
Yin Qing.

95
00:09:15,185 --> 00:09:17,585
You worked beside Anian for three years.

96
00:09:18,625 --> 00:09:20,505
How can you still smile?

97
00:09:21,785 --> 00:09:23,105
Have you even thought about

98
00:09:24,545 --> 00:09:26,785
what Zhili must be feeling right now?

99
00:09:26,865 --> 00:09:27,785
I've told you.

100
00:09:29,785 --> 00:09:31,185
I am Shangguan Zhao,

101
00:09:32,345 --> 00:09:33,545
not Yin Qing.

102
00:09:39,985 --> 00:09:40,825
Fine.

103
00:09:43,825 --> 00:09:44,785
Then let all of this

104
00:09:44,865 --> 00:09:46,425
end as soon as possible.

105
00:09:58,105 --> 00:10:00,345
Madam, a letter from Qingzhou.

106
00:10:36,905 --> 00:10:37,745
Anian.

107
00:10:39,625 --> 00:10:40,785
Anian.

108
00:10:49,625 --> 00:10:50,905
Anian.

109
00:11:23,025 --> 00:11:25,225
Beijian's First Prince's head.

110
00:11:25,305 --> 00:11:26,625
I've brought it to you.

111
00:11:27,105 --> 00:11:30,065
Thank you, Daning, for
ridding me of Beijian royalty.

112
00:11:30,145 --> 00:11:33,505
Today, by order of Zhongwan's
Empress Murong Yao,

113
00:11:34,145 --> 00:11:35,505
I've come for your head.

114
00:11:35,585 --> 00:11:36,825
Shangguan Zhao.

115
00:11:37,505 --> 00:11:39,225
If I could once give you a way to live,

116
00:11:39,825 --> 00:11:41,305
I can also send you to your death.

117
00:11:41,385 --> 00:11:42,385
Shangguan Zhao.

118
00:11:43,065 --> 00:11:44,185
Anian's blood debt

119
00:11:44,265 --> 00:11:45,665
must be repaid in blood.

120
00:11:47,065 --> 00:11:48,425
All soldiers, hear my command!

121
00:11:57,945 --> 00:11:58,785
Stop!

122
00:12:20,225 --> 00:12:21,145
I, Murong Yao,

123
00:12:22,825 --> 00:12:25,465
as the last blood of
Zhongwan's royal house,

124
00:12:26,025 --> 00:12:27,545
command every soldier of Zhongwan

125
00:12:28,025 --> 00:12:29,185
to lay down your weapons.

126
00:12:29,265 --> 00:12:30,665
Princess, you cannot!

127
00:12:35,465 --> 00:12:36,345
Yin Qing.

128
00:12:37,985 --> 00:12:39,545
Your obsession is restoring the kingdom.

129
00:12:40,945 --> 00:12:42,065
Mine

130
00:12:43,385 --> 00:12:45,425
is giving Zhongwan's people peaceful lives

131
00:12:45,505 --> 00:12:47,425
so they never have to
wander homeless again.

132
00:12:47,505 --> 00:12:49,385
Soldiers of Zhongwan,

133
00:12:49,465 --> 00:12:51,185
if war begins today,

134
00:12:51,265 --> 00:12:52,825
Zhongwan will bear the first blow.

135
00:12:53,385 --> 00:12:55,545
Every neighboring state will
seize the chance to fight.

136
00:12:56,625 --> 00:12:58,625
Do you truly want to restore Zhongwan,

137
00:13:00,505 --> 00:13:01,905
or destroy the entire realm?

138
00:13:09,945 --> 00:13:10,865
Ying Gua.

139
00:13:10,945 --> 00:13:13,585
Your father killed my father and mother

140
00:13:13,665 --> 00:13:15,345
and destroyed my homeland.

141
00:13:15,905 --> 00:13:17,785
I should hate you to the bone.

142
00:13:17,865 --> 00:13:19,065
And yet, in the end,

143
00:13:19,785 --> 00:13:21,505
I cannot even bring myself to resent you.

144
00:13:21,585 --> 00:13:23,265
Because I know

145
00:13:23,345 --> 00:13:25,665
you also cannot bear to
see the people suffer.

146
00:13:26,505 --> 00:13:27,825
In your own way,

147
00:13:29,345 --> 00:13:32,025
you are trying to end the
hatred between our nations.

148
00:13:32,585 --> 00:13:34,745
Can there ever be a
clean slate between us?

149
00:13:42,625 --> 00:13:44,505
You cannot even bring yourself to stab me.

150
00:13:45,665 --> 00:13:47,105
How am I supposed to believe you?

151
00:13:48,825 --> 00:13:50,305
I know how hard this has been for you.

152
00:13:51,705 --> 00:13:52,665
But rest assured.

153
00:13:53,785 --> 00:13:55,865
Whatever choice you make,

154
00:13:57,225 --> 00:13:58,505
I will stand by you.

155
00:14:08,465 --> 00:14:09,705
Beijian raids Xigu Pass in three days.

156
00:14:10,505 --> 00:14:11,665
Their arrows will be poisoned.

157
00:14:12,665 --> 00:14:13,825
One scratch

158
00:14:13,905 --> 00:14:15,585
will be fatal.

159
00:14:15,665 --> 00:14:17,385
I never doubted you.

160
00:14:18,105 --> 00:14:19,385
In Daning's household registers,

161
00:14:19,465 --> 00:14:21,465
there will no longer
be Daning and Zhongwan.

162
00:14:21,545 --> 00:14:22,425
This realm

163
00:14:23,825 --> 00:14:25,705
belongs to all its people.

164
00:14:29,905 --> 00:14:31,905
Here is the new Zhongwan policy.

165
00:14:32,385 --> 00:14:34,225
Hereditary slave status is abolished.

166
00:14:35,065 --> 00:14:36,265
From this day forward,

167
00:14:36,345 --> 00:14:37,425
they will be freed from slavery,

168
00:14:37,505 --> 00:14:38,505
given farmland,

169
00:14:38,585 --> 00:14:40,345
and allowed to serve
in office or the army.

170
00:14:40,425 --> 00:14:42,745
This is Zhongwan's
people's true way forward.

171
00:14:44,185 --> 00:14:45,025
Sir.

172
00:14:45,545 --> 00:14:47,065
The survivors have been pardoned.

173
00:14:47,145 --> 00:14:49,265
From now on, there is
no Zhongwan slave camp.

174
00:14:51,185 --> 00:14:52,025
Princess.

175
00:14:52,105 --> 00:14:53,865
Daning is deceitful. It cannot be trusted.

176
00:14:53,945 --> 00:14:55,345
When Daning's iron cavalry

177
00:14:55,425 --> 00:14:56,785
stormed Zhongwan's royal capital,

178
00:14:56,865 --> 00:14:58,505
did they show us even a shred of mercy?

179
00:14:58,585 --> 00:14:59,905
From this day forward...

180
00:15:04,105 --> 00:15:04,945
Your Majesty.

181
00:15:06,185 --> 00:15:08,265
I swear upon my imperial blood:

182
00:15:08,345 --> 00:15:09,425
in the household registers,

183
00:15:10,025 --> 00:15:11,585
there shall be only people of Daning,

184
00:15:12,145 --> 00:15:13,665
never Zhongwan or Daning apart.

185
00:15:14,505 --> 00:15:15,665
If I break this oath,

186
00:15:15,745 --> 00:15:17,305
may the mountains and rivers forsake me.

187
00:15:18,545 --> 00:15:19,385
Meng Tinghui.

188
00:15:19,465 --> 00:15:20,825
I promise you here and now:

189
00:15:20,905 --> 00:15:21,825
all Zhongwan lands of old

190
00:15:22,465 --> 00:15:23,505
shall be yours.

191
00:15:23,585 --> 00:15:24,945
Zhongwan

192
00:15:25,505 --> 00:15:27,385
shall stand as a realm within the realm.

193
00:15:27,465 --> 00:15:28,465
Princess.

194
00:15:29,465 --> 00:15:32,025
Ying Gua only wants a rightful
claim to you and Zhongwan.

195
00:15:32,105 --> 00:15:34,545
What I offer you is the entire realm.

196
00:15:34,625 --> 00:15:36,305
I will make you

197
00:15:36,385 --> 00:15:37,625
the first woman Emperor in history.

198
00:15:41,465 --> 00:15:42,305
Ying Gua.

199
00:15:42,985 --> 00:15:44,185
The lands Zhongwan lost,

200
00:15:44,265 --> 00:15:45,585
I will reclaim by the sword.

201
00:15:45,665 --> 00:15:47,145
I do not need your charity.

202
00:15:47,905 --> 00:15:49,465
Soldiers of Zhongwan, hear my command!

203
00:15:49,545 --> 00:15:51,145
Kill every Daning dog!

204
00:15:51,225 --> 00:15:52,625
Reclaim our homeland!

205
00:16:03,665 --> 00:16:04,825
Sir.

206
00:16:05,385 --> 00:16:06,665
Stop clinging to this madness.

207
00:16:06,745 --> 00:16:07,945
Yin Qing.

208
00:16:08,985 --> 00:16:09,825
Give it up.

209
00:16:15,785 --> 00:16:17,425
I have waited all these years

210
00:16:19,305 --> 00:16:20,825
and plotted my entire life.

211
00:16:25,265 --> 00:16:27,905
Even if I am the last
Zhongwan man alive today,

212
00:16:29,425 --> 00:16:31,625
I will never give up.

213
00:16:49,745 --> 00:16:50,945
Meng Tinghui.

214
00:16:59,345 --> 00:17:00,425
Princess.

215
00:17:00,505 --> 00:17:02,585
Since you want to return
to Daning so badly,

216
00:17:04,105 --> 00:17:05,465
I'll grant your wish.

217
00:17:06,945 --> 00:17:07,985
-Shangguan Zhao!
-Princess!

218
00:17:14,465 --> 00:17:15,505
Sir!

219
00:17:19,065 --> 00:17:19,905
My lord.

220
00:17:21,985 --> 00:17:24,825
You've already killed
Daning's greatest criminal.

221
00:17:24,905 --> 00:17:26,705
Go back to Daning.

222
00:17:34,065 --> 00:17:35,865
-Loose!
-No!

223
00:17:48,105 --> 00:17:49,265
Sir!

224
00:18:05,065 --> 00:18:08,065
Forget Shangguan Zhao.

225
00:18:11,825 --> 00:18:15,065
Remember Yin Qing.

226
00:18:17,705 --> 00:18:18,665
My lord.

227
00:18:23,905 --> 00:18:25,465
I can see...

228
00:18:28,145 --> 00:18:29,865
a rainbow.

229
00:18:34,745 --> 00:18:35,585
Lord Meng.

230
00:18:36,065 --> 00:18:37,265
Are you the one...?

231
00:18:37,825 --> 00:18:38,865
I'm Yin Qing.

232
00:18:38,945 --> 00:18:41,425
From all my years roaming the jianghu,

233
00:18:41,945 --> 00:18:43,865
traveling across mountains and rivers,

234
00:18:43,945 --> 00:18:46,185
and reading countless books,

235
00:18:49,585 --> 00:18:51,065
I can tell it's because you two

236
00:18:51,145 --> 00:18:52,825
were born beautiful.

237
00:18:54,905 --> 00:18:56,345
What office was I just promoted to again?

238
00:18:58,585 --> 00:18:59,905
-Deputy Director Yin.
-Deputy Director Yin.

239
00:19:02,585 --> 00:19:04,385
No matter how fierce the
storms of this world,

240
00:19:04,905 --> 00:19:06,625
one day they will pass.

241
00:19:07,625 --> 00:19:08,465
Yin Qing.

242
00:19:09,305 --> 00:19:10,145
Thank you.

243
00:19:10,625 --> 00:19:11,785
My lord.

244
00:19:12,745 --> 00:19:13,865
As long as Yin Qing lives,

245
00:19:14,505 --> 00:19:15,505
I will keep you safe.

246
00:19:18,385 --> 00:19:19,465
Brother Shangguan!

247
00:19:25,785 --> 00:19:27,305
Brother Shangguan!

248
00:19:31,345 --> 00:19:33,585
Brother Shangguan!

249
00:19:43,465 --> 00:19:45,185
Brother Shangguan!

250
00:19:58,985 --> 00:20:00,625
Don't go!

251
00:20:01,825 --> 00:20:02,865
Don't!

252
00:20:14,265 --> 00:20:15,105
Sir.

253
00:20:18,385 --> 00:20:20,145
I've come to join you.

254
00:20:28,985 --> 00:20:30,225
Situ Xue.

255
00:22:04,585 --> 00:22:05,545
Mengmeng.

256
00:22:06,105 --> 00:22:07,145
Mengmeng, you're awake.

257
00:22:07,225 --> 00:22:08,825
Are you hungry? Do you
want something to eat?

258
00:22:08,905 --> 00:22:09,785
Some water?

259
00:22:13,225 --> 00:22:14,065
Here.

260
00:22:15,425 --> 00:22:16,465
You're finally back.

261
00:22:16,545 --> 00:22:18,545
I thought I'd never see you again.

262
00:22:20,145 --> 00:22:21,425
The war is over.

263
00:22:23,865 --> 00:22:25,985
Now we can finally be together in peace.

264
00:22:28,225 --> 00:22:29,865
I still want to see you

265
00:22:29,945 --> 00:22:32,185
open Bofeng House all across the realm.

266
00:22:34,065 --> 00:22:36,225
Daning's soldiers respect
and honor you now.

267
00:22:36,305 --> 00:22:37,865
No one will ever question
who you are again.

268
00:22:38,825 --> 00:22:40,785
Zhishu and I have made up too.

269
00:22:41,305 --> 00:22:42,185
I think

270
00:22:42,265 --> 00:22:43,705
this is the best ending we could hope for.

271
00:22:43,785 --> 00:22:45,825
Young Lord Shen is utterly devoted to you.

272
00:22:47,065 --> 00:22:49,065
Knowing you have such
a good man beside you,

273
00:22:50,025 --> 00:22:51,185
puts my heart at ease.

274
00:22:52,145 --> 00:22:53,265
And what about you?

275
00:22:54,065 --> 00:22:55,545
You and His Majesty...

276
00:22:58,505 --> 00:22:59,345
Fuzhi.

277
00:23:03,505 --> 00:23:04,825
I don't know why,

278
00:23:06,265 --> 00:23:07,785
but lately I keep thinking about

279
00:23:07,865 --> 00:23:09,585
that old tree at Shazhou Women's Academy.

280
00:23:09,665 --> 00:23:11,785
And I keep craving apricot-skin cakes.

281
00:23:11,865 --> 00:23:13,425
Then I'll make some for you right now.

282
00:23:14,905 --> 00:23:15,745
What's wrong?

283
00:23:16,665 --> 00:23:18,225
This is a military camp.

284
00:23:18,305 --> 00:23:19,425
Where will you find ingredients?

285
00:23:19,505 --> 00:23:20,585
If you want something,

286
00:23:20,665 --> 00:23:21,705
Even if I must pluck down stars,

287
00:23:21,785 --> 00:23:22,785
I'll get it for you.

288
00:23:22,865 --> 00:23:23,705
Wait for me.

289
00:23:24,625 --> 00:23:25,465
I will.

290
00:23:35,585 --> 00:23:36,585
Look at this batch...

291
00:23:39,025 --> 00:23:40,225
Mengmeng?

292
00:24:06,425 --> 00:24:07,665
To His Majesty.

293
00:24:08,665 --> 00:24:10,105
The realm was your betrothal gift,

294
00:24:10,185 --> 00:24:11,505
as you promised.

295
00:24:13,025 --> 00:24:14,705
To offer the rest of my life to this realm

296
00:24:14,785 --> 00:24:16,225
is my duty as your subject

297
00:24:16,865 --> 00:24:18,385
and the heart of the one who loves you.

298
00:24:20,425 --> 00:24:21,505
This game is over.

299
00:24:21,985 --> 00:24:23,145
To withdraw when the work is done

300
00:24:23,825 --> 00:24:25,545
is how neither of us fails the other.

301
00:24:27,145 --> 00:24:29,065
I worry only for Zhili and Fuzhi.

302
00:24:30,465 --> 00:24:32,025
Zhili has lost Anian

303
00:24:32,105 --> 00:24:33,705
and is broken with grief.

304
00:24:34,385 --> 00:24:36,105
Fuzhi burns as fiercely as fire

305
00:24:36,585 --> 00:24:37,705
and can easily burn herself.

306
00:24:38,625 --> 00:24:40,705
I ask you and Zhishu

307
00:24:40,785 --> 00:24:42,945
to keep them safe and
peaceful all their lives.

308
00:24:43,825 --> 00:24:44,825
This is

309
00:24:45,625 --> 00:24:46,785
my final selfish request.

310
00:24:48,345 --> 00:24:50,105
I take my weariness with me

311
00:24:50,745 --> 00:24:52,545
and leave behind endless clear skies.

312
00:24:52,625 --> 00:24:53,945
This is my way of setting us both free.

313
00:24:55,105 --> 00:24:56,945
May you rule all beneath Heaven with care,

314
00:24:57,025 --> 00:24:58,585
guard these mountains and rivers,

315
00:24:58,665 --> 00:25:00,185
and be remembered as a wise Emperor.

316
00:25:01,745 --> 00:25:02,825
And may I always remain

317
00:25:02,905 --> 00:25:04,545
the Meng Tinghui of the
Office of Public Inquiry,

318
00:25:04,625 --> 00:25:07,065
who debated statecraft
with you by lamplight.

319
00:25:08,465 --> 00:25:11,425
May every night you read memorials,

320
00:25:11,985 --> 00:25:15,825
the candle beside your desk burn warm.

321
00:25:32,465 --> 00:25:34,625
(Three years later)

322
00:25:57,785 --> 00:25:58,625
Di An!

323
00:26:02,305 --> 00:26:03,145
Di An!

324
00:26:09,545 --> 00:26:10,385
Mother!

325
00:26:12,905 --> 00:26:14,065
Di An.

326
00:26:19,985 --> 00:26:21,665
No fooling around before His Majesty.

327
00:26:26,505 --> 00:26:27,625
Mother.

328
00:26:27,705 --> 00:26:29,505
I'm better than Father.

329
00:26:30,865 --> 00:26:32,625
Then you must first train hard.

330
00:26:44,985 --> 00:26:46,265
Mother,

331
00:26:46,345 --> 00:26:48,025
why did you like Father?

332
00:26:56,345 --> 00:26:57,185
Zhili.

333
00:27:12,265 --> 00:27:13,585
It wasn't just liking him.

334
00:27:15,265 --> 00:27:16,345
I loved him.

335
00:27:17,625 --> 00:27:18,585
I only realized it too late.

336
00:27:21,905 --> 00:27:22,745
Di An!

337
00:27:25,665 --> 00:27:26,945
Uncle!

338
00:27:36,145 --> 00:27:37,985
Good boy. I'll take you
to the training grounds

339
00:27:38,065 --> 00:27:39,585
where your father used to practice.

340
00:27:45,545 --> 00:27:47,865
Uncle, I'm going to be a great general.

341
00:27:49,545 --> 00:27:50,825
I'll protect Mother

342
00:27:50,905 --> 00:27:52,025
and protect His Majesty.

343
00:28:02,545 --> 00:28:08,425
-Good.
-Good.

344
00:28:09,025 --> 00:28:10,905
Good.

345
00:28:12,105 --> 00:28:12,945
Manager Yan.

346
00:28:13,025 --> 00:28:14,945
With His Majesty's
"Imperial Merchant" plaque,

347
00:28:15,025 --> 00:28:15,865
we lead the capital

348
00:28:15,945 --> 00:28:17,705
among its seventy-two merchant houses.

349
00:28:18,945 --> 00:28:20,185
This is only the beginning.

350
00:28:20,265 --> 00:28:21,865
I want Bofeng House branches

351
00:28:21,945 --> 00:28:22,905
all across Daning.

352
00:28:23,505 --> 00:28:25,145
I'm heading to Xuzhou and Bianzhou

353
00:28:25,225 --> 00:28:26,185
to look at new locations.

354
00:28:26,265 --> 00:28:28,145
I'll leave the capital's twelve branches

355
00:28:28,225 --> 00:28:29,345
in all your hands.

356
00:28:30,265 --> 00:28:31,105
-Yes.
-Yes.

357
00:28:31,185 --> 00:28:32,185
Manager Yan!

358
00:28:32,785 --> 00:28:33,905
Manager Yan!

359
00:28:33,985 --> 00:28:35,225
Wonderful news!

360
00:28:35,305 --> 00:28:37,545
Young Lord Shen has won
another great victory.

361
00:28:37,625 --> 00:28:39,185
He's about to be promoted and ennobled.

362
00:28:39,825 --> 00:28:40,705
With such good fortune,

363
00:28:40,785 --> 00:28:42,425
why are you still fussing
over new branches?

364
00:28:44,465 --> 00:28:46,145
Precisely because they're all high above,

365
00:28:46,705 --> 00:28:48,265
I need to lay the road on the ground

366
00:28:48,345 --> 00:28:49,705
even farther ahead.

367
00:28:51,425 --> 00:28:52,305
Let's go.

368
00:28:53,785 --> 00:28:55,705
-Safe travels, Proprietor!
-Safe travels, Proprietor!

369
00:28:58,185 --> 00:28:59,425
Have a safe journey, Proprietor!

370
00:29:02,505 --> 00:29:04,345
-Congratulations!
-Congratulations!

371
00:29:04,425 --> 00:29:05,385
Safe travels!

372
00:29:22,385 --> 00:29:24,945
With a wise ruler's grace above,

373
00:29:25,025 --> 00:29:28,465
-With a wise ruler's grace above,
-With a wise ruler's grace above,

374
00:29:28,545 --> 00:29:30,985
and worthy ministers serve below,

375
00:29:31,065 --> 00:29:33,585
-and worthy ministers serve below,
-and worthy ministers serve below,

376
00:29:33,665 --> 00:29:35,425
only then can we govern the realm,

377
00:29:35,505 --> 00:29:38,025
-only then can we govern the realm,
-only then can we govern the realm,

378
00:29:38,105 --> 00:29:39,665
nurture the people,

379
00:29:39,745 --> 00:29:41,905
-nurture the people,
-nurture the people,

380
00:29:41,985 --> 00:29:43,345
and secure lasting peace.

381
00:29:43,425 --> 00:29:45,425
-and secure lasting peace.
-and secure lasting peace.

382
00:29:45,505 --> 00:29:47,865
If my life can serve the people,

383
00:29:48,425 --> 00:29:50,385
I shall not spare myself.

384
00:30:36,145 --> 00:30:38,985
You impersonated Situ Xue
and deceived the people.

385
00:30:39,065 --> 00:30:41,305
You hid military weapons
and plotted rebellion.

386
00:30:41,385 --> 00:30:42,665
By law, you should be exiled.

387
00:30:42,745 --> 00:30:44,265
What makes you think I'm an impostor?

388
00:30:52,105 --> 00:30:53,705
You're selfish and self-serving,

389
00:30:53,785 --> 00:30:55,025
and every word from you is a lie.

390
00:30:55,105 --> 00:30:56,745
Once exposed, you twist your words,

391
00:30:56,825 --> 00:30:59,265
and play innocent and pitiful at will.

392
00:30:59,345 --> 00:31:01,865
You're cunning, deceitful, and two-faced.

393
00:31:01,945 --> 00:31:03,585
How do I know you're not lying to me?

394
00:31:06,505 --> 00:31:08,865
You certainly remember me well.

395
00:31:28,025 --> 00:31:28,945
We meet again,

396
00:31:29,985 --> 00:31:31,025
Miss Meng.

397
00:31:35,465 --> 00:31:36,865
With all your power,

398
00:31:37,465 --> 00:31:39,065
why not wipe out Black
Tiger Hall and Ding Chong?

399
00:31:39,145 --> 00:31:40,985
Why keep making life hard
for a helpless woman?

400
00:31:41,465 --> 00:31:42,625
What skill is there in that?

401
00:31:43,185 --> 00:31:44,265
You dared deceive me?

402
00:31:44,345 --> 00:31:46,665
Then you're courting death.

403
00:31:47,345 --> 00:31:49,105
Since I brought you in,

404
00:31:49,185 --> 00:31:50,665
I won't let anything happen to you.

405
00:31:52,185 --> 00:31:53,785
A master like Young Master He

406
00:31:54,265 --> 00:31:55,385
is afraid of a little snake?

407
00:32:00,945 --> 00:32:02,545
At least buy me a meal first.

408
00:32:13,665 --> 00:32:14,705
Miss Meng.

409
00:32:16,985 --> 00:32:17,865
Until next time.

410
00:32:18,905 --> 00:32:19,745
If fate allows,

411
00:32:20,585 --> 00:32:21,825
we will meet again.

412
00:32:26,345 --> 00:32:28,865
I think He Du of Shazhou

413
00:32:28,945 --> 00:32:30,385
was more interesting

414
00:32:31,145 --> 00:32:32,305
than the Emperor you are now.

415
00:32:35,705 --> 00:32:36,665
Young Master He.

416
00:32:36,745 --> 00:32:38,145
Warm broth in your stomach...

417
00:32:38,665 --> 00:32:40,305
Does the lamb broth taste good?

418
00:32:41,745 --> 00:32:42,705
It's good.

419
00:32:43,665 --> 00:32:44,865
Very good.

420
00:32:44,945 --> 00:32:46,945
These lamb noodles taste
just like Shazhou's.

421
00:32:47,425 --> 00:32:49,345
Still spicy. Still fierce.

422
00:33:17,745 --> 00:33:18,585
You truly

423
00:33:18,665 --> 00:33:21,385
made your way to stand
before me, step by step.

424
00:33:30,705 --> 00:33:31,985
Young man.

425
00:33:34,145 --> 00:33:35,105
He Du.

426
00:33:35,985 --> 00:33:36,865
Your Majesty.

427
00:33:38,465 --> 00:33:40,665
For ten years, under different identities,

428
00:33:41,385 --> 00:33:42,865
you have witnessed my life.

429
00:33:45,505 --> 00:33:47,025
Why wait for snow to make a wish?

430
00:33:48,305 --> 00:33:50,345
I grant wishes better than Heaven.

431
00:33:53,305 --> 00:33:56,065
I wish Daning peace and prosperity.

432
00:33:56,985 --> 00:33:59,225
And I hope next season,

433
00:34:00,265 --> 00:34:01,425
old friends are still beside me.

434
00:34:04,745 --> 00:34:05,945
When spring comes,

435
00:34:06,785 --> 00:34:08,425
shall we release river lanterns together?

436
00:34:08,505 --> 00:34:09,945
It's a promise.

437
00:35:16,905 --> 00:35:17,865
Your Majesty.

438
00:35:31,345 --> 00:35:32,585
Meng Tinghui.

439
00:35:34,425 --> 00:35:35,505
Let's get married.

440
00:35:58,025 --> 00:35:58,905
It's been three years.

441
00:35:59,505 --> 00:36:00,425
Daning has missed you.

442
00:36:01,825 --> 00:36:03,665
The storms at court are not over yet.

443
00:36:05,265 --> 00:36:07,025
Will you walk this road with me again?

444
00:36:08,749 --> 00:36:10,749
MkvDrama.net

